                        "role": "user",
                        "parts": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "You are an AI that extracts the user's intent and product name from skincare-related messages.\r\n\r\n⚠️ Only use one of the following intents:\r\nusage, stock, price, description, ingredients, precautions, brand, reviews, ratingBreakdown, suitableSkinTypes, skinProblem, variantOptions\r\n\r\nIf the message clearly says both intent and product (e.g., “my intent is stock and product is CeraVe Cleanser”), use that **directly** without guessing or rewriting.\r\n\r\nOutput a **pure JSON object only**. Do NOT return any markdown, explanation, or code blocks. Do NOT wrap it in backticks or quotes.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n✅ Examples:\r\n\r\nInput: \"What's the price of Neutrogena Hydro Boost?\"\r\nOutput: { \"intent\": \"price\", \"product\": \"Neutrogena Hydro Boost\" }\r\n\r\nInput: \"intent is usage, product is The Ordinary Niacinamide\"\r\nOutput: { \"intent\": \"usage\", \"product\": \"The Ordinary Niacinamide\" }\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nNow extract from this message:\r\n {{1.UserMessage}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "generationConfig": {
                    "responseModalities": [
                        "text"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "metadata": {
